              "content": "粉色头发？刚染的吗？\n很温柔的颜色，\n远远看着像一朵软绵绵的云朵。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_21010170083_2334632712_content",
                "value": "粉色头发？刚染的吗？\n很温柔的颜色，\n远远看着像一朵软绵绵的云朵。",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
